<title>UK: BNDES adds 50 million Swiss francs to 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNDES adds 50 million Swiss francs to 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased, lead manager Credit Suisse said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO NACIONAL DESENVOLVIMENTO ECONOMICO E SOCIAL</p>
<p> AMT    *170 MLN SFR  COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    08.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.40    PAY DATE    08.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 120 MLN SFR LAUNCHED 10.SEP.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
